---
layout: layouts/base.njk
seoTitle: Volunteer with a Cat Rescue in St. Augustine | Feline Fairies
title: Volunteer with Feline Fairies
description: Learn ways to volunteer with Feline Fairies, a foster-based cat rescue serving St. Augustine, Florida.
pageStyles:
  - /assets/css/interior.css
  - /assets/css/forms.css
---


<section class="volunteer-open">

  <div class="shell volunteer-open__top">

    <div>

      <p class="eyebrow">
        Volunteer with us
      </p>

      <h1>
        Your time can mean
        <em>so much.</em>
      </h1>

    </div>

    <p>
      Feline Fairies runs on neighbors willing to lend a hand. There are different ways to contribute, from time with cats to practical work behind the scenes.
    </p>

  </div>


  <div class="shell volunteer-open__rule">

    <span aria-hidden="true">
      ✦
    </span>

  </div>

</section>



<section class="volunteer-ways">

  <div class="shell volunteer-ways__grid">

    <div>

      <p class="eyebrow">
        Ways to help
      </p>

      <h2>
        Bring what you can.
      </h2>

      <p style="color:var(--body)">
        Availability and needs change. Use the application to share your interests and skills.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="volunteer-ways__list">

      <article>

        <h3>
          Events
        </h3>

        <p>
          Help with outreach and adoption activities when opportunities are available.
        </p>

      </article>


      <article>

        <h3>
          Cat care
        </h3>

        <p>
          Share time helping cats feel comfortable, where the rescue needs support.
        </p>

      </article>


      <article>

        <h3>
          Transport
        </h3>

        <p>
          Help with practical trips when arrangements and needs align.
        </p>

      </article>


      <article>

        <h3>
          Behind the scenes
        </h3>

        <p>
          Offer organization, communication, or other skills that support volunteers.
        </p>

      </article>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>



<section class="notice-section">

  <div class="shell">

    <div class="notice">

      <strong>
        Before you apply:
      </strong>

      Tell us what you are interested in, your availability, and any relevant experience. Submission does not guarantee a particular volunteer role.

    </div>

  </div>

</section>



<section class="form-layout">

  <div class="shell">

    <div class="form-layout__heading">

      <div>

        <p class="eyebrow">
          Volunteer application
        </p>

        <h2>
          Let’s find your place.
        </h2>

      </div>

      <p>
        The volunteer application will appear here once the official Jotform is connected.
      </p>

    </div>


    {% set formConfig = forms.volunteer %}
    {% set formSize = "standard" %}
    {% include "components/form-embed.njk" %}

  </div>

</section>



<section class="after-form">

  <div class="shell after-form__grid">

    <div>

      <p class="eyebrow">
        What happens next
      </p>

      <h2>
        We’ll be in touch.
      </h2>

    </div>

    <p>
      The team can review your interests and follow up about current needs and next steps. You can also
      <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>
      with a question.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>